    "turn_idx": 32,
    "turn_text": "I'll say this, Eric, we will look back at this time in America, I believe, as the beginning of the end of the two-party system in America. I really believe that. It's difficult in this country, but there's some revolutionary stuff, I think, going on out here. And I think within the next 10 to 12 years, you're gonna see some viable other parties.",
