  {
    "episode_id": 51104,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/1/51104.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 36,
    "turn_text": "Well, and here's our problem though. The Republican Party is a cult, and it's a shrinking cult. I mean, right now, Eric, what is the Republican Party? It's a bunch of, and I can say this, because I was one, a bunch of old white guys who live out in the country. That's a shrinking population. And unless the Republican Party figures out how to get people of color and young people and women, it's going to just fade away.",
